# Frontend patterns

- Routes in `frontend/app/`; shared UI in `frontend/components/`.
- All API calls via `api()` from `@/lib/api`; errors via `apiErrorMessage()`.
- Protect pages with `@frontend/components/auth-gate.tsx` (`admin` / `player` flags).
- Display scores and balances from API responses only—never derive pass/fail or ledger totals locally.
- Env: `NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL` for API origin; use `cache: 'no-store'` (already set in `api()`).
